      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Mannslagan ⁊ mánswaran, hádbrecan ⁊ ǽwbrecan gebugan ⁊ gebetan oððe of cyððan mid synnan gewitan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Murderers and perjurers, injurers of the clergy and adulterers shall submit and make amends or depart with their sins from their native land.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Manslagan ⁊ mánswaran, hádbrecan ⁊ æwbrecan gebugan ⁊ gebétan, oððe of cyððe mid synnan gewítan.</ab>
      </div>
